 or trucks. <a href=\"/recreational-wrap-toronto-2/\">Click here</a> to see more recreational wraps.</p> <p>We also offer branded water bottles to help cool off during the summer heat. We can wrap almost any item you bring us.</p> <p>Like us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, Heart us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a> and add a Comment on <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a>.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/nusens-decals-van-ford-transit/", "text": "Prev Previous Nusens Decals – Van Ford Transit – Avery and 3M wraps"}, "next": {"href": "/metro-jet-wash-vinyl-partial-car-wrap/", "text": "Next Metro Jet Wash Car Wrap – Custom Vehicle Graphics Next"}}]}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500", "tag": "p"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Share This Post", "href": null, "style": "text-align:ce